    "privacy_zone_not_found": {
      "message": "Could not find privacy zone with name {zone_name} on camera {camera_name}"
    },
    "protect_version": {
      "message": "Your UniFi Protect version ({current_version}) is too old. Minimum required: {min_version}"
```

